12
00:01:47,166 --> 00:01:48,041
Bite.

13
00:01:48,458 --> 00:01:49,333
Clearly.

14
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,041
That's clearly <i>maida.</i>

15
00:01:51,958 --> 00:01:53,874
- You're absolutely right.
- Yeah.

16
00:01:53,875 --> 00:01:56,707
It's gonna take about ten minutes
because, you know, <i>ragi</i> needs its time.

17
00:01:56,708 --> 00:01:57,583
Yeah.

18
00:02:00,166 --> 00:02:01,083
Take your time.

19
00:02:02,083 --> 00:02:02,958
And…

20
00:02:03,375 --> 00:02:05,541
