25
00:02:14,916 --> 00:02:16,458
Spicy?

26
00:02:16,916 --> 00:02:18,666
Doesn't look like she can handle it.

27
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,708
Hey! I can handle it.

28
00:02:20,833 --> 00:02:22,083
You can? Okay then.

29
00:02:22,208 --> 00:02:24,500
Especially for the table, our very own…

30
