I'll see you there.

55
00:03:17,625 --> 00:03:19,916
Okay, baby. I'm headed to the salon.

56
00:03:20,208 --> 00:03:21,582
Call me if you need anything, okay?

57
00:03:21,583 --> 00:03:23,541
Why would I need anything?
I'm a…

58
