82
00:04:39,166 --> 00:04:40,125
Yeah.

83
00:04:40,625 --> 00:04:41,916
Baby, I don't want to go.

84
00:04:42,041 --> 00:04:44,708
Come on, let's go.
We'll dance with everyone.

85
00:04:45,250 --> 00:04:47,333
