191
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:50,749
He doesn't even flirt.

192
00:14:50,750 --> 00:14:51,958
<i>Is he a cheater?</i>

193
00:14:52,166 --> 00:14:53,750
<i>Is he a cheater?</i>

194
00:14:53,875 --> 00:14:55,458
<i>Is he a cheater?</i>

195
00:14:55,583 --> 00:14:59,750
<i>Cheater, cheater, cheater…</i>

196
00:15:06,750 --> 00:15:07,749
{\an8}Yeah, baby?

197
00:15:07,750 --> 00:15:08,625
{\an8}<i>Baby!</i>

198
