223
00:16:26,958 --> 00:16:29,040
That massage therapist
was too hard on me.

224
00:16:29,041 --> 00:16:30,666
It was really bad for me.

225
00:16:31,250 --> 00:16:35,750
Now I have to spend all day on my feet,
working with that French pastry chef.

226
00:16:37,125 --> 00:16:38,125
