attending every wedding on Earth.

452
00:29:49,500 --> 00:29:50,375
Oh.

453
00:29:52,375 --> 00:29:55,249
Kunal, can you grab a bottle
from the wine cellar downstairs, please?

454
00:29:55,250 --> 00:29:56,583
- Yeah, of course.
- Yeah?

455
00:29:56,791 --> 00:29:58,416
- Downstairs?
- Yeah, on the right.

456
00:29:59,708 --> 00:30:01,415
Thank you.
Be right back, baby.

457
00:30:01,416 --> 00:30:02,333
Yeah.

458
00:30:06,541 --> 00:30:08,041
Can I ask you an aunty-type question?

459
00:30:09,333 --> 00:30:10,583
Why aren't you guys married yet?

460
00:30:11,333 --> 00:30:13,332
You seem perfect together.

461
00:30:13,333 --> 00:30:16,541
If only I knew what he was thinking,
I could do something about it.

462
00:30:18,541 --> 00:30:19,916
If I asked, he'd even do it.

463
00:30:20,333 --> 00:30:21,375
But I don't want that.

464
00:30:22,500 --> 00:30:23,416
He loves me.

465
00:30:23,875 --> 00:30:26,208
Maybe just not enough to marry me.

466
00:30:26,500 --> 00:30:31,666
Maybe he's still with me

467
00:30:32,416 --> 00:30:34,250
just to avoid a messy breakup.

468
00:30:34,625 --> 00:30:36,208
Our families are close too.

469
00:30:36,500 --> 00:30:39,250
Has he ever hinted he's not happy
in this relationship?

470
00:30:43,541 --> 00:30:44,749
No, not really.

471
00:30:44,750 --> 00:30:47,416
So you've just created this whole story
in your head?

472
00:30:47,916 --> 00:30:50,457
There has to be a reason behind
that thought process.

473
00:30:50,458 --> 00:30:54,000
Maybe he's waiting for you to say,
"Let's get married."

474
00:30:54,500 --> 00:30:55,500
I know what you're…

475
00:30:57,875 --> 00:30:58,750
Found it?

476
