doesn't want to commit.

497
00:32:14,041 --> 00:32:15,041
Will you do me a favor?

498
00:32:15,625 --> 00:32:17,125
Yeah, anything. Tell me.

499
00:32:20,666 --> 00:32:22,458
Can you make him fall for you?

500
00:32:23,125 --> 00:32:24,000
